  "title": "Easy Chimichurri Sauce",
  "description": "Originally from Argentina and Uruguay, chimichurri is an uncooked sauce made with fresh herbs, garlic, and olive oil. It can be used as a marinade or served with grilled meats.",
  "authors": [
